---
---
<section id="about" class="mb-24 scroll-mt-24 pt-12" aria-label="About Me">
  <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-8">
    <h3 class="text-3xl font-display font-bold text-text">About Me</h3>
    <div class="h-px bg-glass-border flex-grow"></div>
  </div>
  
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-5 gap-12 items-center">
    <div class="md:col-span-3 text-[18px] leading-[1.7] text-text-muted space-y-6 animate-on-scroll animate-slide-right">
      <p>
        I'm a B.Tech AI & ML student at R.C. Patel Institute of Technology (GPA 9.20), currently working as an AI Research Intern at Tagowls and running my own freelance AI/web development practice.
      </p>
      <p>
        My work spans NLP applications, RAG-based systems, and agentic AI workflows &mdash; I care about building things that are technically sound and genuinely useful, not just demo-able. I thrive on solving complex problems with elegant code.
      </p>
      <p>
        When I'm not coding, I'm usually exploring new tech trends, reading about artificial general intelligence, or thinking about how to optimize the next big project.
      </p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="md:col-span-2 flex justify-center animate-on-scroll animate-fade-up delay-200">
      <div class="relative group w-64 h-64 md:w-full md:h-auto max-w-sm">
        <div class="absolute -inset-4 bg-gradient-to-r from-accent to-purple-500 rounded-xl opacity-20 group-hover:opacity-40 blur transition duration-500"></div>
        <div class="relative aspect-square rounded-xl overflow-hidden border-2 border-glass-border glass-panel">
          <!-- TODO: Replace src with actual photo -->
          <img 
            src="/avatar-placeholder.jpg" 
            alt="Tanisha Badgujar" 
            class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105"
          />
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-accent/10 mix-blend-overlay group-hover:bg-transparent transition-colors duration-500"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
